            decisions/actor_as_first_class_metamodel_class_with_mm_actor_slots_2026_05_20.md
            so :mm/Actor can claim both :ai-actor and :human-actor.
            Sister attribute to :dt/native-codec (which selects the
            codec FORMAT) — :dt/codec-type-keyword selects the CLASS
            within a chosen codec.  Unique-identity per VALUE so each
            keyword in the set is independently a unique-identity lookup
            for its class."}

  {:db/ident :dt/codec-aliases
