   :dt/label "Symmetric Property"
   :db/doc "OWL 2 owl:SymmetricProperty alignment.  A property whose value is bidirectional: (?p type SymmetricProperty) ∧ (x p y) → (y p x).  Compiles to OWL 2 RL rule prp-symp."}

  {:db/ident :dt/AsymmetricProperty
   :dt/type :dt/Class
